>> time required: 20 minutes
>> course: condiment

Baker's percentages with rice vinegar as the 100% base, the finished mix comes to 123.75% of the vinegar weight
Mix @rice vinegar{100%}, @sugar{18.75%} and @salt{5%} in a small bowl and stir until the sugar and salt are dissolved
Warm gently if the sugar is slow to dissolve, do not boil or you will drive off the vinegar
Against the dry rice weight that is 21% vinegar, 3.94% sugar and 1.05% salt, 26% of seasoning in total
For 180g of dry rice that is 37.8g rice vinegar, 7.1g sugar and 1.9g salt, 46.8g of seasoning
For 500g of dry rice that is 105g rice vinegar, 19.7g sugar and 5.3g salt, 130g of seasoning
